WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.263
The sun was high in the sky.

2
00:00:04.264 --> 00:00:07.314
And it was very hot.

3
00:00:07.315 --> 00:00:13.908
"Ugh! It's so hot today," said Bird.

4
00:00:13.909 --> 00:00:18.693
"This is the hottest day ever!" said Kip.

5
00:00:18.694 --> 00:00:21.581
"Let's go to the beach," said Bird.

6
00:00:21.582 --> 00:00:25.014
"We can cool off in the water."

7
00:00:25.015 --> 00:00:31.505
The two friends walked.

8
00:00:31.506 --> 00:00:44.665
Even the sidewalk was hot.

9
00:00:44.666 --> 00:00:49.522
"Ouch! My feet!" said Bird.

10
00:00:49.523 --> 00:00:52.590
Bird hopped from one foot to the other.

11
00:00:52.591 --> 00:00:57.358
"Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!" said Kip.

12
00:00:57.359 --> 00:01:01.178
Kip hopped too.

13
00:01:01.179 --> 00:01:04.195
They hopped all the way to the beach.

14
00:01:04.196 --> 00:01:13.472
The beach was crowded.

15
00:01:13.473 --> 00:01:17.182
"Look at all these feet," said Bird.

16
00:01:17.183 --> 00:01:23.109
"I can't see the ocean," said Kip.

17
00:01:23.110 --> 00:01:27.062
Bird and Kip walked through the crowd.

18
00:01:27.063 --> 00:01:36.785
Then they saw the water.

19
00:01:36.786 --> 00:01:39.920
The waves were too big for a small bird.

20
00:01:39.921 --> 00:01:48.871
And they were too big for a chipmunk.

21
00:01:48.872 --> 00:01:52.535
"We can't go in the water," said Kip.

22
00:01:52.536 --> 00:01:57.125
"How are we going to cool off?"

